{
  "name": "updateCorsPolicy",
  "title": "Update CORS Policy",
  "description": "Update an existing CORS policy by ID on the global AM CorsService. Performs a full replacement on the wire (fetch-then-PUT): the current policy is fetched first, any provided fields are merged over it, and the complete policy is PUT back to AM. Fields not supplied are preserved from the existing policy.",
